Yep.

892
01:41:44,258 --> 01:41:47,738
Good morning, everybody. I'm Régine Vine from Sorbonne

893
01:41:47,778 --> 01:41:51,598
University in Paris. This presentation was prepared with

894
01:41:51,778 --> 01:41:55,658
several colleagues. Two are present with you in

895
01:41:55,738 --> 01:41:57,818
Oslo if you would like to discuss further,

896
